		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020090"},
		line=717,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"After school lets out, Akari and I head for the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We're headed there to visit Kotone, who was absent from school today owing to poor health.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"We're led by a priestess to Kotone's private chambers.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone? How are you feeling?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, Akari-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Kotone, who had been lying down, sits up to greet us.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The priestesses said you overused your magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, I may have strained myself a bit much.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But after a full day of bed rest, I feel most refreshed now.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Good.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, here. We brought you a little get-well gift.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Akari hands her a paper bag.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ahh, this packaging is from Samuraya! C-Could it be?!”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's those sake manjuu you were talking about.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you so much! Thank you so much!”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Passing out from fatigue was all worth it!”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She rips opens the bag and breathes in deep lungfuls of the wafting aroma.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"I'm glad she likes it so much.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't know much about magicks, but why does using it drain so much of your stamina?”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That is a most difficult question.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Kotone crosses her arms and silently ponders for a while.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perhaps it might be accurate to say that the fatigue from using magicks is an offering to Oomikami.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Kotone reverently withdraws a manjuu from the paper bag.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“In its simplest form, what we refer to as magicks are simply prayers to Oomikami asking Him to grant our wishes.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But for these supplications to be heard by Him, one needs to provide adequate compensation.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“This compensation may take many different forms.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“At times it may require a monetary offering, at other times, a sacrifice, and even other times, a manjuu.”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"She blissfully chews on the sake manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Other than that, I shupposhe there'sh shtaminomnomnom...”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So it's not just being tired from all the concentration of praying, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Magicks are much more profound than you think, are they not? Eh-heh!”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"Kotone puts her hands on her hips and puffs out her chest.",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At any rate, I'm relieved to see you're okay.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry we pushed you beyond your means.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might you be saying, sir?!”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It's the sacred rite of a priestess to answer the needs of the warriors.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Please, by all means, continue to work me to the bone!”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"Kotone brightly bows her head at me.",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That aside, regarding the bombing from the other day, might you have any ideas who the perpetrators are?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Nope. Though it doesn't seem like the warriors were responsible.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Truth be told, I actually investigated the scene myself last evening.”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You went to the scene of the bombing? Inside the Republican occupation?!”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"The Imperial Palace is located inside the Republican occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"You need a specially issued visa to enter, and any attempted trespassers are shot on sight.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, no, I merely used some Scrying magicks from here in the Imperial Temple. Please do not worry.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“However, I would ask that you keep what I am about to tell you a secret.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"Kotone says gravely, lowering her voice.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That explosion was most likely caused by magicks.”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?! Then the culprit is...”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A priest or a priestess... Someone of the priesthood.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“If this is indeed the case, then as the Exalt-Priestess, I have no excuses for the public.”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"As a general rule, only those of the priesthood are able to use magicks.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"While there may be certain exceptions like the manager,\nthey're few and far between.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I attempted to trace the lingering residues of spellforce there until dawn, but I was unable to ascertain the identity of the perpetrator...”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I humbly beg your forgiveness for my failure.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You didn't do anything wrong! You must've really tried your best.”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Your graciousness is wasted on me.”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"Kotone bows her head deeply.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, there is one further matter which I am concerned about.”",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It seems that a portion of the Imperial Palace's walls have collapsed owing to the explosions the other day.”",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, there's a hole in it now. We heard about it last night from our spies.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, that is correct.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“From what I could gather, I believe that the entrance likely leads to an underground passage.”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“An secret escape route, maybe?”",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If so, that makes it perfect for us to sneak in.”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Y-You intend to sneak into the Imperial Palace?!”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"As Kotone's eyes spin around in their sockets, I tell her about what we've been able to find out about Kokuan-dono.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Then, in order to rescue Kokuan-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. If the Sworn Blades are to have a future, we absolutely must save him.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I see...”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Kotone munches her manjuu with a mysterious expression.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hey, Soujin, if we're gonna break into the Imperial Palace anyways, how about we go after the Three Sacred Treasures along the way?”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't think there's any rush to prove your lineage anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori has already accepted you, and the Sworn Blades will be fine operating on the premise that Empress Hisui is genuine.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Think about it. Isn't the situation different now?”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Now that your spellblades are gone, the Sworn Blades\ndon't have the strength needed to take down Okonogi, right?”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But if the Three Sacred Treasures can really do what the legends say, they'll be able to help the Sworn Blades turn the tables.”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So that's what you meant.”",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"The Three Sacred Treasures are a blade, a mirror, and a magatama said to have been bestowed upon the first Empress, Himi-no-Mikoto, by Oomikami Himself.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"The blade is said to be capable of cutting down any calamity, and the mirror is said to confer protection against any calamity.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Finally, the magatama is said to bestow its holder with all worldly knowledge.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Though they may appear as ordinary artifacts, they are said to be capable of unleashing power which rivals that of the gods when wielded by the Empress.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Do you know what the Treasures are capable of?”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ugh. That's the thing... I don't.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My mother said she'd tell me when I became Empress, but, well...”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Do you have any ideas, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Even among the priesthood, very little is known for certain...”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Regarding t",
{"ruby", text="Elysian Looking-Glass"},
"he Ame no Mikagami an",
{"/ruby"},
"d the  ",
{"ruby", text="Jewel of August Majesty"},
"Yasakani no Magatama,",
{"/ruby"},
" we know little more than what the legends say.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But as for th",
{"ruby", text="Exalted Divine Blade"},
"e Ame no Mitsurugi, ",
{"/ruby"},
"there are somewhat detailed accounts in the histories of yore.”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Kotone reaches out and pulls out one scroll from a veritable mountain of texts.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“According to scholars, the Ame no Mitsurugi was beheld on the battlefield seventeen times.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There are records stating, 'The Ame no Mitsurugi scoured the enemy with its radiance' or 'Its power safeguarded the realm from peril.'”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There are accounts of previous Exalt-Priestesses having Honed the Ame no Mitsurugi, so it must be a most powerful spellblade indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Priestesses of old possessed incredible magicks that far outstrip the priestesses of today.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“And it was from their souls that this legendary blade was forged.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is only natural that such an Artifact would possess power of cataclysmic proportions.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Kotone declares confidently as she gobbles up another manjuu.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A spellblade that powerful, huh? I'd love to get our hands on it.”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"Having lost seventy percent of our arsenal, you could say we have had our very limbs torn off.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"If we can obtain a spellblade with cataclysmic powers, the Forbidden Guard won't stand a chance.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“In that case, let's go after the Ame no Mitsurugi then.”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm sure Inou will go along with it!”",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's give it a shot.”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Akari-sama, are you aware of where the Treasures are stored?”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's a temple deep in the palace called ",
{"ruby", text="Celestial Pavilion"},
"the Shireiden for",
{"/ruby"},
" the Emperor's private use only. They're probably in there.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perhaps this goes without saying, but please do be careful.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“We still have no idea who it was that had reason to open the hole in the palace wall.”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, thanks.”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll have our spies investigate the passage inside the opening.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It'd be a shame if it led straight to a dead end.”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"On the way home from the Imperial Temple, I spot a familiar figure in the crowd.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"It's Maki.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"His imposing stature stands out in public.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Heading home from school, are we?”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"His skin is flushed.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"He must have been drinking.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You could say that.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"My eyes are drawn to the bouquet he's holding.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"I recognize the wrapping paper.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You paid our shop a visit?”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Thought I'd give 'em to a certain lady friend.”",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Visiting a woman at this hour? Some gentleman you are.”",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hey, you've got yourself a woman with you, too.”",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We don't have that kind of relationship.”",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“What about Inou?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“She takes care of you in aaaall sorts of ways, ain't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your vulgar suspicions are unfounded.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“That's the spirit.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“A warrior has no need of romance.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Try heading down that primrose path, and you'll only lose your way.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Make sure you remember that, To-ki-ta.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"He claps me roughly on the shoulder, flashing a meaningful grin.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"The heavy weight of his hand is a testament to his strength.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You've got some nerve, talking a big game like that.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you're still bringing flowers to someone, aren't you?”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“My romance is of the one-night variety.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“A nice, stimulating liaison that expires as soon as the sun comes up.”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You scumbag!”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hahahahaha, wouldn't have it any other way!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Later, Tokita.”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Having said his piece, Maki swaggers away in his usual manner.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"That's",
{"/font"},
" one of the heads of the Three Founders? You've gotta be kidding me.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's just how he is.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're awfully tolerant of his womanizing...”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Figures. You're still a guy, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"Feigning exasperation, Akari walks on ahead.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"When I turn around, I notice the back of Maki's head sticking out above the crowds.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Sensing my gaze, Maki turns around and meets my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"He looks like he's speaking to me, but the glare of the setting sun is too bright for me to read his lips.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
